  "kind": "STUDYUS_HUMAN_REVIEW_FORM",
  "version": "2",
  "about": "One slot per sampled item: a first human review and, when required, a second by another person. Ten independent judgements per review. Dev-test content; a human decision here is a calibration label, not a Question Bank approval.",
  "noAi": "Both reviews are by people. Do not consult an AI system. A reviewer identity that is an AI or a model, or a review marked as AI-assisted, is refused. The second review is never the AI reviewer.",
